<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-30T20:57:04.558Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 20:57:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Al-Zaidi has taken direct control of Iraq's intelligence service while Iran pressures Iraqi militias and PJAK elements. Baghdad and Damascus are advancing talks on the Sharaa pipeline, border security and oil exports, and Iraq signed a gas capture agreement with US firm Morgan Hughes. Security forces dismantled a drug-trafficking network, arresting 31 suspects, and Erbil police detained four suspects in a woman's murder, while the PMF denied paying Iranian advisers. The memorial unveiled in Erbil honors victims of the 2024 Iranian missile attack, and 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBmVWpMYVhoYmlQYThRX2NBekVoUG5UREZvYXBRejIyMTBHam1QTXE2Q2ZEYWZEcTBxUldJY3V1aUJ4aWFaMmFhRjBfR0VMQV9yV1B0MU5GeU5PaC1SbFB3NkhEYzc1cHQtREtkdWNQdnpBUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Task &amp;amp; Purpose&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxORm5YaHNRM3hGQ1ZWQ2k1ckhKenlVLTRXa3l2U3pYSnF6MGpHNEduYlhrdVJpNGtyYmt0Q2hVVnk0VjVDQUg2M0lyVVFuUFQ2NTZYU1haWTlBWHlnT3BndTN0QjZmUW9EbEhQaGd6SF9uXzBzU1QzaDBMTElKempRMnhxbXdKajY1MkFKSzQ1TUI0R1A5ZGJHS3FCZi1qRFVqVktKWlBBRVFuaXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;MEMRI | Middle East Media Research Institute&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPT25GYlplT0VFYWZXZ0lndTJINHg4R3d3cDJFZTVucE1fY2pNeXRvUko3c2ZYNmcwellIb2dTZmFGYXZtRUotTnFJU1ZtME9yMmlCdGItTV9PRE0xTDl5ejhXTWJNTFE1SXY5TzJfVUk4UG4wY3lhWTdkVlJpVDZRN2hicnh4b3h5d2Q3TzBoN3ZxRExvYjVYVmE3aktlTmRtNkJSSXY0UGVSNGpEakpWdmJfcXRldTV0d3hXN3plcFAyX1RR?oc=5&quot;&gt;FDD's Long War Journal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE56dWd2SnVfVU5tZVo5azc3Q3Q5QXFkUUpWeVFIOEp6SWZFQzFzWWVnRVRfa2hGSU01MlRPd2ZlMTJFS2YzcXRhb2hDYUxjc29YX20xRUdOZEozUXJjaHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw